    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "Welcommme, one and allllll, to the Fireblade Arena\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fifteen teams! Fifteen knights!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Today's match is a one-and-done! We'll see plundering! Crazy battles! Tight escapes and desperate chases! Welcome to the third largest arena in Kazimierz, manmade to unleash the deathmatch within every knight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that? You say one match only earns you one point!? Where does THAT happen!?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not here, not now! In this match, any valid attack against a fellow knight means a valid score, and that means points! Points, for fat stacks of cash!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "But who cares if a bunch of point-grabbers play a game!? No, I know! I know what it is you all really wanna see\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "You wanna watch the heroes fall! You wanna watch the great stars crash to the ground! Thaaaat's right! This season's melee matches have a new rule in the mix, the 'Points Off' clause! You hear that, knights? Risk and reward in one!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's the spice when your points never drop?! In this match, we're following the 'Predator System!' Let's keep it simple, sister: when someone goes up one, someone else is goin' down one!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, yeah! Believe it, I'm scrapping to see what the do-it-alls do! Our rising stars, swallowed up! It's unprecedented, folks! A match to flip the rankings head to toe!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thought you could qualify for the Major by wining it up in a bubble bath?! You'd better risk it all right here, right now! Get ready to rumble, because the world's watching!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121#3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't forget, our sponsored drones from Raythean Industries will be broadcasting every knight's viewpoint non-stop! Our eight registered Knights Association referees won't miss a single detail!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, the knights are making their final checks, the crew are fitting their armor with the sensory chips! How many stars will be born today, and how many are gonna eat dirt and taste crushing defeat?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can only wait\u2014for the knights\u2014to enterrrrrr\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
