    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_101"
    },
    {
        "text": "What the hell? This guy again? Isn't he supposed to keep to Roar Guards territory?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Guess he found his own rising star, now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nah... 'Points Off?' They ever have a 'Points Off' in the melees before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "And they announced this all-new system right before the match started. What, they can just do that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't bet on the Association being all this capricious, did we... and it doesn't bode well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
