    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like all fifteen knights are readied at their places! Once the crew are out of the way, the match will officially begin!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "A full sixty minutes of battle! Unless every knight is down for the count, this battle goes to the very last second!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if your points for this season take a sub-zero dive, you'll still be in the game! Wanna see backs against walls? Last-gasp attacks? You're in the right place, folks!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Maria Nearl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Who're you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmm... just one of your fans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright\u2014! All fifteen knights are signalling ready!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's make it quick. The moment the Brassrust Knight healed up, Ashley\u2014my Ashley\u2014sent him straight back to the hospital. Man, the Ingras have been down on their luck for weeks now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "I declare\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, Ashley took me right to the playoffs, so I've been a little panicked. Thought I'd try and make up a few points here. But I didn't think I'd find you too, young Nearl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Why don't we go for a little t\u00eate-\u00e0-t\u00eate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Let the Fireblade Melee\u2014begiiiiiiiiinnnnn\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
